{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced battles with fully destructible buildings simulation. Gather special attacks by filling up the destruction meter on each level and defeat the meanies by blasting their towers in strategic locations. Accumulate power-ups to customize the destruction. Developed by a structural engineer - these structures are flexible which means they will bend and twist before collapsing. The meanies will fire back, and you must act quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/2426d25a33cd424d307cd966a5c6de11.poster.avif?t=1769666113\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/2426d25a33cd424d307cd966a5c6de11.webm?t=1769666113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/2426d25a33cd424d307cd966a5c6de11.mp4?t=1769666113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible real-time 3D building destruction </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 unique, structurally engineered levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full VR support, and non-VR play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/e56ceaf6d444826f949d5ddfc2ee3422.poster.avif?t=1769666113\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/e56ceaf6d444826f949d5ddfc2ee3422.webm?t=1769666113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/e56ceaf6d444826f949d5ddfc2ee3422.mp4?t=1769666113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups and special attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode with earthquake simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personality type assignment!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/091842af8456a6d46f63a2a43bac1bc7.poster.avif?t=1769666113\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/091842af8456a6d46f63a2a43bac1bc7.webm?t=1769666113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/091842af8456a6d46f63a2a43bac1bc7.mp4?t=1769666113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out sandbox mode demo <strong>available now!</strong> With support provided by a grant from the Autodesk Foundation, Bent on Destruction features next-generation building destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Please review the minimum system requirements - the physics are computationally intense which reduces framerate on older machines.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1691020?t=1769666113","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/657949c0310e8495f5ae06207d21a85fa70ee62e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769666113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/b5c8fdcf8bbe42cc03818520a9b3fc75befaa85a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769666113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/b5c8fdcf8bbe42cc03818520a9b3fc75befaa85a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769666113","categorie